/tr> </tbody> </table> <table> <thead> <tr> <th>Mature Age Pathway (MAP)</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td> Minimum academic requirement <p>MAP involves an interview and a portfolio submission to be assessed by the Academic Chair of the course. Admission is based on relevant work and life experience. Applicants must also meet the English Language Competency requirements for the course. <a href="mailto:domesticadmissions@murdoch.edu.au">Email us for more information</a>.</p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td> Minimum English requirement <p>Evidence of completing year 11 and 12 in Australia at any Level (Domestic Applicants Only).</p><p>Evidence of completing a minimum of 2 years of studies at TAFE or an RTO (Domestic Applicants Only).</p><p>Must be met according to the respective courses standard ELC requirements, STAT Written English 140, etc.</p> ​<br/> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table>',
