application that demonstrates relevant aptitude and ability in a related learning area.​ Find out more about the <a href="https://www.murdoch.edu.au/study/pathways-to-uni/enabling-pathways/experience-based-entry">Experienced based entry</a>.<p><br/></p><p><b>For Law:</b></p><p>No direct entry​</p><p><br/></p> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table>',
